  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 20-layer planar dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Materials: alternating hfo2 and SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) layers, starting with hfo2 as layer 1. Total 20 dielectric layers (10 HfO2, 10 SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos)). Wavelength bands: 200-400 nm (maximize reflectance), 800-1500 nm (maximize transmittance). Design variables: individual thickness for each of the 20 layers. Thickness bounds: HfO2 layers 30-50 nm, SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) layers 40-60 nm. Incidence angle: 0 degrees (normal incidence). Polarization: unpolarized or both TE and TM averaged. Use gradient_thickness optimizer with increased mutation intensity for first two rounds to escape previous local optimum, then taper perturbation as scores improve.",
